{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411170","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1441117001:1":{"text":"目に大砲をぶち込んでも、びくともしないなんてな……","source_cn":"炮火进了它的眼连一粒灰尘都不如……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB7E01DE1F09680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441117002:1":{"text":"あれが、竜というものなんだな……","source_cn":"龙，就是这样的存在吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06B682D9CB533FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441117003:1":{"text":"研究に研究を重ね、改造を繰り返した自信作だったのになあ。","source_cn":"天知道我在研究所里研究、改造、迭代了多少次！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F383A6F6B319200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441117004:1":{"text":"エネルギー集束の仕組みも、変換効率も、貫通精度もバッチリだったのに……！","source_cn":"聚能的方式，转换的效率，贯穿的精度……赫托啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F4233E15524F40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1441117004":{"text":"エネルギー集束の仕組みも、変換効率も、貫通精度もバッチリだったのに……！","source_cn":"聚能的方式，转换的效率，贯穿的精度……赫托啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F4233E15524F40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1441117005:1":{"text":"遥か昔、各地を渡り歩き、故郷のオルディン村に辿り着いたドワーフたちがいた。","source_cn":"很久以前，四处流亡的矮人们回到了故土深岩村。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDACFFE8780B42A50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1441117006:1":{"text":"そして、ここに眠るヤルン帝国と神の技術をその目で見たくて、真っ先に地下遺跡の探索に向かったんだ。","source_cn":"为了亲眼见证钢心帝国和神明的伟大工艺，第一件事就是勘探...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D6E7136EFC8CDAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1441117007:1":{"text":"探索隊の先陣部隊の中で、一番若かった隊員がこのオレさ。他のやつが躊躇するような場所も、かまわず真っ先に飛び込んだ。","source_cn":"我是勘探队年纪最小的先锋，别人不敢钻的坑洞、不敢探的矿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5B262BCB4E0C5B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1441117008:1":{"text":"竜の卵を間違って飲んじまったのもその時だよ。それから、ずっとこの姿のままなんだ。","source_cn":"也是在那个时候，我误饮了龙蛋液，一直保持这副模样到现在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77D3B19EED0AF65E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1441117008":{"text":"竜の卵を間違って飲んじまったのもその時だよ。それから、ずっとこの姿のままなんだ。","source_cn":"也是在那个时候，我误饮了龙蛋液，一直保持这副模样到现在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77D3B19EED0AF65E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1441117009:1":{"text":"「永遠の若さ」ほどタチの悪い呪いはないよ。","source_cn":"“永葆青春”，多狡猾的龙，多别出心裁的诅咒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1542614A3DCD55DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1441117010:1":{"text":"オレと一緒に、失われた帝国の技術を探し求めてたヤツらは、みーんな年を取った。","source_cn":"当年那些和我一起追寻失落的钢心帝国技艺的伙计们老了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF718F7E7E70F85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1441117011:1":{"text":"帝国技術の再現なんて、とっくに諦めてるし、中には到底理解できない道に進んだ者もいる。","source_cn":"大部分人都放弃了重现钢心帝国的技艺，少数人走上了我不认...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA61CFF180B3BEDAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1441117012:1":{"text":"けど、オレは覚えてる。この姿を見る度に、竜の呪いは消えてないって思い知らされるんだ。","source_cn":"只有我记得，我的模样时刻提醒着我，龙的诅咒从来没有消失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D9DD43BDAAFFEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1441117013:1":{"text":"竜はドワーフを憎んでいる。あいつが生きている限り、ドワーフにかけられた呪いは永遠に消えない。","source_cn":"它憎恨着矮人，只要它存在一日，矮人血脉的诅咒就会延续下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE71337BC8329731","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","do